{"title":"Career roadmap · Fabric Sourcing Specialist","role":"Fabric Sourcing Specialist","summary":"A Fabric Sourcing Specialist identifies, evaluates and procures fabrics and textile materials that meet a brand's design, quality, cost, sustainability and production requirements. The role sits between textile design, product development, suppliers, mills, manufacturers and fashion brands.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Textile Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong alignment, particularly when the student develops additional skills in textile science, supplier management, costing, quality control and international sourcing."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Textile Design","Textile/Sourcing Internship","Sourcing Assistant","Fabric Sourcing Executive","Fabric Sourcing Specialist","Senior Sourcing Specialist","Sourcing Manager","Head of Sourcing / Materials Director"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Master textile fundamentals, fabric identification, sourcing and supplier evaluation"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in fashion sourcing, sustainable materials, technical textiles or global sourcing"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Manage supplier portfolios, costing, quality and large sourcing programmes"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into sourcing leadership, materials strategy, sustainability or global supply-chain management"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Textile fundamentals"},{"text":"Fibres + yarns + fabric"},{"text":"Fabric identification library"},{"te